060.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Two giant dams starved the Danube Delta of sediment for decades]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134176427.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The Danube's sediment supply to its delta has significantly decreased due to upstream engineering works. Large dams like the Iron Gates trap sediment, altering the natural balance of the delta. This reduction in material has led to increased coastal erosion along the delta's seaward edge. Recently, ten obsolete dams were removed from smaller rivers to reconnect fragmented habitats.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/two-giant-dams-changed-europes-second-longest-river-decades-later-scientists-found-the-danube-delta-was-being-starved-of-sediment/articleshow/134176427.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/two-giant-dams-changed-europes-second-longest-river-decades-later-scientists-found-the-danube-delta-was-being-starved-of-sediment/articleshow/134176427.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-13T09:38:17+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134176876,imgsize-1492856.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Owens Slams Erika Kirk: Conservative firebrand alleges ‘biggest betrayer’; rift over Charlie’s legacy]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134163946.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Candace Owens has intensified her public feud with Erika Kirk, claiming Charlie Kirk was “betrayed” and naming his wife as his “biggest betrayer.” Owens said she initially expected Turning Point USA and Erika to help uncover answers after Charlie’s death but later felt shut out. She also alleged that people connected to Erika targeted her. These remain Owens’ claims and have not been independently established by the material provided.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/it-would-be-his-wife-candace-owens-accuses-erika-kirk-of-turning-against-charlie-kirks-legacy/articleshow/134163946.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/it-would-be-his-wife-candace-owens-accuses-erika-kirk-of-turning-against-charlie-kirks-legacy/articleshow/134163946.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-13T05:31:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134164005,imgsize-2461605.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Alleged Auto Theft Booking: US YouTuber reportedly in custody; online campaign backs Brandon’s release]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134164237.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[YouTuber Brandon Buckingham was reportedly arrested in Louisiana on an alleged “Theft of Auto/Vehicle” charge, according to a booking notice shared online. The Washington Parish Sheriff's Office was reportedly listed as the booking agency, with no bond set at the time. Buckingham’s official X account responded with “Free Brandon” and promoted merchandise supporting his release. However, details surrounding the alleged offense remain unclear, and no court outcome was provided.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/why-was-youtuber-brandon-buckingham-arrested-the-alleged-auto-theft-charge-and-latest-details-explained/articleshow/134164237.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/why-was-youtuber-brandon-buckingham-arrested-the-alleged-auto-theft-charge-and-latest-details-explained/articleshow/134164237.cms]