><title><![CDATA[Mass protests erupt in Germany as AfD eyes breakthrough in eastern states]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134171697.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A massive turnout in Erfurt, Germany saw protesters actively blocking access to the AfD's annual conference, showcasing a strong opposition to the far-right party's agenda. The AfD's lead in national opinion polls and its upcoming eastern state election objectives raise alarms over its increasing power. Mainstream parties continue to adopt a strategy of isolation, refusing to collaborate with the AfD as tensions escalate.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/mass-protests-erupt-in-germany-as-afd-eyes-breakthrough-in-eastern-states/articleshow/134171697.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/mass-protests-erupt-in-germany-as-afd-eyes-breakthrough-in-eastern-states/articleshow/134171697.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-13T07:44:55+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vijaya Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134172137,imgsize-205930.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Toll in Philippines ferry fire rises to 76; 13 missing]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134167941.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/toll-in-philippines-ferry-fire-rises-to-76-13-missing/articleshow/134167941.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/toll-in-philippines-ferry-fire-rises-to-76-13-missing/articleshow/134167941.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-13T06:04:37+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.